{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1628","id":4088453524,"node_id":"PR_kwDOO5D6p87zsNmU","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1628","diff_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1628.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1628.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/issues/1628","number":1628,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"[codex] Repair residual local VLM batch extraction","user":{"login":"Samsen879","id":172257175,"node_id":"U_kgDOCkRvlw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172257175?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Closes #1627\n\n## What changed\n\nDiagnosed every one of the 16 residual rows from #1621 against the official source pages and preserved raw responses. The committed root-cause matrix records source/crop/render hashes, both raw passes, normalized output, exact failing fields, specific cause, repairability, and the bounded repair for each row.\n\nThe local-only runner now:\n\n- constructs the two proven missing continuation regions from a candidate-blind overlay;\n- binds dynamic frozen question identity and tells the model to ignore page numbers;\n- limits subparts to printed parenthesized labels;\n- deterministically expands nested parents and qualifies bare roman labels;\n- safely reconciles whole-question ownership, including a sole numeric owner only when it equals the frozen question identity;\n- preserves checkpoint/resume, completion-first execution, row-level continuation, mark-count gating, and mismatch non-merging.\n\nSix reference-truth fields were corrected only from direct official-page evidence. The field-level diffs are preserved in a new candidate-blind truth overlay; all #1621 baseline artifacts remain hash-validated and unchanged.\n\n## Verification result\n\nOrdered verification completed as required:\n\n1. First targeted 16-row run: 10/16, exposing six parseable whole-question owner values rejected by normalization; 32 local calls, 0 transport failures.\n2. Focused normalizer repair plus unequal/multiple-owner fail-closed tests.\n3. Second fresh targeted 16-row run: 16/16; 32 local calls, 0 failures, retries, mismatches, fallbacks, or false overrides.\n4. Fresh full 71-row run: 71/71, with 0/55 regressions among the original correct rows and 0 silent missing rows.\n\nExact full-run before/after:\n\n| Measure | Before | After |\n| --- | ---: | ---: |\n| Question number | 68/71 | 71/71 |\n| Visible subparts | 58/71 | 71/71 |\n| Visible marks | 62/71 | 71/71 |\n| Candidate writing | 70/71 | 71/71 |\n| Foreign annotation | 70/71 | 71/71 |\n| Fully correct rows | 55/71 | 71/71 |\n| Provider failures | 0 | 0 |\n| False overrides | 0 | 0 |\n| Mark-count mismatches | 0 | 0 |\n| Fallbacks | 1 | 0 |\n| Residual rows | 16 | 0 |\n\nThe full run used 142 local API calls with zero provider failures or retries. Paid external calls and remote/canonical/production/public writes were all zero.\n\n## Checks\n\n- `python scripts/vlm/__tests__/issue_1627_residual_repair.test.py` — 13/13 passed\n- `python scripts/vlm/__tests__/issue_1621_unseen_batch.test.py` — 11/11 passed\n- `python scripts/vlm/__tests__/issue_1620_local_two_pass.test.py` — 24/24 passed\n- `npm run quality:report-index` — pass, 0 violations\n- `npm run build` — pass\n- `npm run deploy:secret-scan` — pass, 0 findings\n- `git diff --check` — pass\n- `npm run workflow:codex-preflight -- --json` — expected warning only for task changes/no upstream; all substantive guards healthy\n\nThis remains candidate-only evidence. It does not perform or authorize canonical promotion, production mutation, remote writes, or public display, and it creates no canonical-write issue.\n","created_at":"2026-07-20T05:02:50Z","updated_at":"2026-07-20T05:36:36Z","closed_at":"2026-07-20T05:36:35Z","merged_at":"2026-07-20T05:36:35Z","merge_commit_sha":"0bc95285812e83fca5fc95ac665c43c5e2a39373","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1628/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1628/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/issues/1628/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/statuses/03906884985bdeee6a3e3ec32deb0742005e8ae0","head":{"label":"Samsen879:task/1627-local-vlm-residual-repair","ref":"task/1627-local-vlm-residual-repair","sha":"03906884985bdeee6a3e3ec32deb0742005e8ae0","user":{"login":"Samsen879","id":172257175,"node_id":"U_kgDOCkRvlw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172257175?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/gists{/gist_id}"